    "limits": [
      "Prepared Survival fixtures supply predecessors, raw theories/materials/initial aura/arena/workbench/pedestal.",
      "Original rope centerline/model/textures are retained; native tube tessellation is an explicit GLE adaptation.",
      "Bench frames may show post-payment results; exact physical payments are established by logs and native tests.",
